### Aura Clean Architecture REST API Spec
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. API Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Retrieve Items
GET {{baseUrl}}/items

### 3. Create Domain Item
POST {{baseUrl}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Aura Domain Entity",
  "description": "Entity description validating DDD rules",
  "status": "active"
}

### 4. Retrieve Specific Item
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/123
